## Lift fix (game-developer#12 / playtester N4) verified
The new `lift_trials.py` reproduces N4 on build-4 (w1-rc4, same lift code as build-3): 1-3 vertical lift keeps the rider in only 1 of 23 landings (rider sinks through while it rises faster than 1 px/frame); the 1-2 rising lifts also fail (a rider sinks, few landings register). On build-5 all of these keep the rider for all 30 landings with no flicker, and the 1-2 down lifts, 1-3 horizontal lifts and 1-4 horizontal lift still pass. My earlier single-landing lift check passed on build-3/4 because it landed at one phase only; the multi-phase trials replace it as the lift check.

## Lift wrap (1-2)
Down lift: rider is carried through the wrap (lift and Mario both reappear at the top, still riding). Up lift: at the wrap the lift jumps to the bottom; Mario is released at the top of the screen (y about -16) and falls; no death, state stays `play`. Not a defect in my view (the lift is a loop), noted for the record.

Open defects from QA: none. Not checked by me: music by ear, real-keyboard feel, a fair play of 1-2..1-4 with all enemies (playtester), firebar timing, pixel fidelity. Observation: 1-4 has no Podoboo.
